// src/v4/extdeps/frameworks/react.dag
//
// Scope: React framework substrate — module surface, function components,
//         elements (host + composite), props sites, ordered child refs,
//         context bindings, hook call sites — declarative.
// Anchor: React **19.2.0** (`react@19.2.0`) —
//   https://github.com/facebook/react/releases/tag/v19.2.0
//   https://react.dev/reference/react — hook roster + partition C1-tracked vs pin;
//   site-only drift without pin edit = STOP.
// Anchor (composition): https://react.dev/learn
// Unifies: (THESIS:188) one substrate carrier set per slice; emit / ingest / eval
//         read distinct facts from the same declarations — extend HERE, not mirrors.
//
// Pin / call-signature (`dsl/extdeps/extdeps.md`):
//   - Each `ReactHookSite` arm: react.dev anchor for **v19.2.0** call shape.
//   - `ReactOptRef` / `ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument`: only where pin admits
//     optional operand or omit-vs-present deps.
//   - Other required operands (e.g. `createContext(defaultValue)`): `ReactCrossDeclRef`
//     fields; `null` defaults stay declaration-backed refs.
//   - Semver / hooks-index bump ⇒ re-audit every arm (STOP on silent drift).
//
// R4 (design-r4-full-stack-omni-emission-canvas.md §4 Q2):
//   - Per-arm `ReactHookSite` — deps / cleanup / refs only on arms that admit them
//     per react.dev (canvas:76 — no phantom deps on every hook).
//   - No standalone lifecycle coproduct: effect obligations on `UseEffect` /
//     `UseLayoutEffect` / `UseInsertionEffect` arms (`ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument`,
//     required `setup_ref`, `ReactEffectCleanupSite`) per §4 + INVARIANTS P1/P2
//     (anti-pattern §11 #12). No `NoEffectBody` — setup required per react.dev.
//   - `CustomHook` + R4-Phase-1.5 Practice-4:
//     docs/design-r4-phase-1-5-hookkind-custom-react-substrate-canvas.md
//
// Owns:
//   - ReactModuleSurface (client vs React Server Components module capability)
//   - ReactFunctionComponent (surface + props + `render_root_ref` declaration edge)
//   - ReactCrossDeclRef — opaque cross-decl ref (TASKS T-4.7 fork vs
//     `std/node.dag::Symbol` until M1(2.7) merge); local for v4-only smoke + stage1
//     closure without `v3.*` / pending `v4.std.node` import.
//   - ReactPropsSite (props type + value sites — `ReactCrossDeclRef` edges)
//   - ReactHostElement / ReactCompositeElement / ReactElement (narrowed **element object**
//     partition per `createElement` return: host + composite + keyed `Fragment`;
//     `key`/`ref` lift per react.dev) + `ReactNode` (🟡 YELLOW — **partial** `children`
//     slice: `Element` | `Text` only; full react.dev / JSX child lattice **Owned ELSEWHERE**;
//     dissolution trigger in-file at `ReactNode` ledger)
//   - ReactContextBinding (`createContext(defaultValue)` site — context object + default)
//   - ReactHookSite — closed hook call-site coproduct under react@19.2.0 pin +
//     `CustomHook` (🟡 YELLOW Practice-4 per design-r4 §12 HookKind; canvas in-repo;
//     dissolution = new built-in at pin bump; see block ledger)
//   - ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument, ReactOptRef, ReactEffectCleanupSite —
//     supporting substrate sums (each: Practice-4 🟢 ledger below).
//
// Consumes (traceability):
//   - std/collection.dag: List<T> (kernel-ambient `List` needs no import for use;
//     listed for single-authority traceability to FreeMonoid modeling)
//   - std/diagnostic.dag: Outcome<T> (D1 / DECISIONS.md **I**) — commentary only
//
// Owned ELSEWHERE: JSX/TSX grammar, portals, Suspense, class components, Next.js
// directives, per-hook algebra inhabitance, GroundingMap home, parse→Outcome ops.
//
// Status: T-4.7 forward-modeled (mgr brief DOC-ANCHOR + A1 + Practice-4).
// HEADER RECONCILE (2026-05-16, operator msg_889d8554, vivid-carp-207):
//   In-PR de-prose: pin/R4/header narrative compressed to bullet facts; no `Owns` /
//   `Consumes` substance change. Practice-8 (PR #3226 interim hollow-alias
//   discriminator): CONFORMANT — no `type X = Y` bare alias to an external spec
//   primitive without coincidence-evidence; `ReactCrossDeclRef` is opaque K-1
//   (TASKS T-4.7 authority-fork note), not std-primitive identity; kernel-ambient
//   `List` traceability only per header `Consumes`.
// Brief: BRIEF_TEMPLATE.md; splitting = operator ratification.


module v4.extdeps.frameworks.react


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactCrossDeclRef
//
// Opaque cross-declaration identity for `*_ref` / `*_refs` fields (K-1, body-less).
// Local carrier until `import v4.std.node { Symbol }` merge (M1(2.7)); TASKS T-4.7
// tracks dissolution to `std/node.dag::Symbol`. Bundle aligns to single-authority
// K-1 / L1 at link time — not a bare alias to a spec primitive (Practice-8).
type ReactCrossDeclRef


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactOptRef
//
// Optional operand at a hook call site (e.g. optional `getServerSnapshot`,
// optional `useDebugValue` formatter, optional `useActionState` permalink,
// optional `useReducer` `init`, optional `useDeferredValue` `initialValue`,
// optional `useOptimistic` `reducer`) —
// encodes arity holes in the **pinned** API surface.
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟢 GREEN (terminal). Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: optional slot duplicated on unrelated hooks.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: nullable ref admits sentinel collision with payload.
//   3. Algebraic form — N/A: not std/ algebra.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: at most one of Present / Absent at each optional site.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not indexed copy of another carrier.
// Terminal: binary optional-ref partition (react@19.2.0 call-site substrate).
type ReactOptRef
  = RefPresent { ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  | RefAbsent


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactEffectCleanupSite
//
// Cleanup function edge, or explicit absence (deps-only / mount-only body).
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟢 GREEN (terminal). Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: cleanup folded into `dependency_refs` blob.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: sentinel int admits “maybe cleanup” ambiguity.
//   3. Algebraic form — N/A: cleanup algebra lives in lowered `Node`.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: XOR cleanup vs no-cleanup at one site.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not `Cleanup<Width>` indexed family.
// Terminal: cleanup-present vs no-cleanup partition on effect-hook arms.
type ReactEffectCleanupSite
  = NoCleanup
  | CleanupBody { cleanup_body_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useEffect — optional `dependencies`
//         argument; **omit** ⇒ Effect re-runs after **every** commit; **present**
//         carries the inline dependency list (empty list = explicit `[]`, distinct
//         from omit per react.dev “dependencies” examples).
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟢 GREEN (terminal). Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: deps live only on a shared `Hook` record (canvas:76).
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: nullable list conflates omit with empty array.
//   3. Algebraic form — N/A: dependency algebra is `Object.is` lane in runtime proof.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: XOR omit-argument vs present-array at one call site.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not `Deps<N>` Practice-7 ladder.
// Terminal: omit-vs-present partition for inline dependency-array parameter sites.
type ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
  = DependenciesArgOmitted
  | DependenciesArgPresent { dependency_refs: List<ReactCrossDeclRef> }


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Modeling notes (A1)
//
// `DependenciesArgPresent.dependency_refs`: ordered dependency-array spine.
// Omit vs present: only `ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument` — never “missing field”
// = empty list. `ReactCrossDeclRef`: declaration edges into lowered `Node` bundle,
// not a second program type. D1: `Outcome<T>` commentary only — no parse rows here.


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactModuleSurface
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/rsc/server-components +
//         https://react.dev/reference/react/use-client
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟢 GREEN (terminal). Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: shared surface tag for coordination + emit.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: Bool proxy admits illegal merged server∧client.
//   3. Algebraic form — N/A: epistemic boundary, not algebra.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: exactly one module-surface tag per authority here.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not Practice-7 mechanical copy over a set.
// Terminal: closed binary React-19 module-capability partition.
type ReactModuleSurface
  = ReactClientModule
  | ReactServerComponentsModule


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactHookSite
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/hooks — built-in Hooks index (pin
//         tracks https://github.com/facebook/react/releases/tag/v19.2.0 ).
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/use — `use(resource)` (`use` API).
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/rules/rules-of-hooks
// Canvas: docs/design-r4-phase-1-5-hookkind-custom-react-substrate-canvas.md
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟡 YELLOW (R4-Phase-1.5; not terminal).
// Authority: design-r4-full-stack-omni-emission-canvas.md §12 — HookKind 🟡;
// promotion canvas: design-r4-phase-1-5-hookkind-custom-react-substrate-canvas.md.
// Dissolution trigger: semver pin / hooks-index edit + new built-in ⇒ re-ratify
// arms on that PR. Structural facts already here (§4 Q2 / canvas:76): per-arm
// signatures; `ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument` for omit-vs-present deps;
// effect arms: required `setup_ref` + `ReactEffectCleanupSite`; no lifecycle sum.
// Canvas does not “close” §12 YELLOW — Custom shape only; roster = pin/index edits.
// Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: shared hook-site tag for resolver/emit.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: Int hook_id admits illegal values (P2).
//   3. Algebraic form — PARTIAL: per-hook algebras live std/ elsewhere.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: exactly one hook arm per call site.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not `F<X>` Practice-7 over a width set.
// Pin call-site partition: 20 arms — 19 built-ins (hooks index + `UseResource` for
// `use(resource)`) + `CustomHook` (`use` API is not a separate twenty-first bucket).
// P1 names track react.dev; effect cleanup only on the three effect arms.
type ReactHookSite
  = UseState { initial_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useReducer — `useReducer(reducer,
  //         initialArg, init?)`; optional third operand is the initializer fn.
  | UseReducer {
      reducer_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      initial_arg_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      init: ReactOptRef
    }
  | UseContext { context_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  | UseRef { initial_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useImperativeHandle — optional deps.
  | UseImperativeHandle {
      ref_target: ReactCrossDeclRef
      factory_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useEffect — `setup` is **required**;
  //         optional deps + optional cleanup returned from setup (modeled on-arm).
  | UseEffect {
      setup_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
      cleanup: ReactEffectCleanupSite
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useLayoutEffect — same required setup.
  | UseLayoutEffect {
      setup_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
      cleanup: ReactEffectCleanupSite
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useInsertionEffect — same required setup.
  | UseInsertionEffect {
      setup_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
      cleanup: ReactEffectCleanupSite
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useEffectEvent — ships **React 19.2**
  //         (https://react.dev/blog/2025/10/01/react-19-2); included because pin ≥19.2.
  | UseEffectEvent { callback_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useMemo — react.dev prose lists
  //         `dependencies` as the second operand; **JavaScript arity** still allows
  //         omitting it (distinct from explicit `[]`; same omit-vs-present story as
  //         `useCallback` troubleshooting). Model via `ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument`.
  | UseMemo {
      factory_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useCallback — `dependencies` may be
  //         **omitted** (react.dev “Troubleshooting”: forgetting the array is legal
  //         arity but yields a **new function every render**). When passed, model as
  //         `DependenciesArgPresent` (including explicit `[]`).
  | UseCallback {
      callback_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      dependencies: ReactHookInlineDependenciesArgument
    }
  | UseTransition
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useDeferredValue — `useDeferredValue(value,
  //         initialValue?)`; optional `initialValue` for the initial render per react.dev.
  | UseDeferredValue {
      value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      initial_value: ReactOptRef
    }
  | UseId
  | UseSyncExternalStore {
      subscribe_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      get_snapshot_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      get_server_snapshot: ReactOptRef
    }
  | UseDebugValue { value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef, format: ReactOptRef }
  | UseActionState {
      action_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      initial_state_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
      permalink: ReactOptRef
    }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/useOptimistic — `useOptimistic(value,
  //         reducer?)`; second operand pure reducer `(currentState, action) => nextState`.
  | UseOptimistic { value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef, reducer: ReactOptRef }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/use — `use(resource)`
  | UseResource { resource_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }
  | CustomHook { implementation_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactPropsSite
// Anchor: https://react.dev/learn/passing-props-to-a-component — props bag for the
//         `props` argument to `createElement` / component receives; **`key` and
//         `ref`** passed there are lifted to **`element.key` / `element.ref`** on the
//         returned element object (not modeled inside this record — see `ReactHostElement` /
//         `ReactCompositeElement`; `Fragment` for keyed fragments; primitive text children
//         are `ReactNode::Text` (🟡 partial slice — see `ReactNode` ledger), not `ReactElement`).
type ReactPropsSite {
  props_type_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
  props_value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
}


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactFunctionComponent
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/function-components
type ReactFunctionComponent {
  surface: ReactModuleSurface
  props: ReactPropsSite
  render_root_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
}


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactHostElement
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react-dom/components +
//         https://react.dev/reference/react/createElement — `key` / `ref` passed in
//         the `props` argument are **not** retained on `element.props`; they appear as
//         `element.key` / `element.ref` on the returned element object (react.dev
//         Parameters / Returns).
type ReactHostElement {
  tag_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
  key: ReactOptRef
  ref: ReactOptRef
  props: ReactPropsSite
  child_refs: List<ReactCrossDeclRef>
}


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactCompositeElement
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/createElement — same `key` / `ref`
//         extraction as host elements (`element.key` / `element.ref`, not `props`).
type ReactCompositeElement {
  component_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
  key: ReactOptRef
  ref: ReactOptRef
  props: ReactPropsSite
  child_refs: List<ReactCrossDeclRef>
}


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactElement
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/createElement (Return value) +
//         https://react.dev/reference/react/Fragment +
//         https://react.dev/reference/react-dom/components
//
// **Narrowed** to the `createElement` **element object** shape (`type`, `props`, `key`,
// `ref` per react.dev Returns) — **not** the broader `...children` node set (primitives,
// arbitrary nodes), which lives on `ReactNode` below.
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟢 GREEN (terminal). Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: reconciler + emit share element-shape tag.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: flat Int-kind admits impossible unions.
//   3. Algebraic form — PARTIAL: host vs composite share props+children spine.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: exactly one element-object kind at this layer.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not `Element<Width>` Practice-7 copies.
// Terminal: `createElement`-style **element object** partition only (React 19.2.0 pin).
type ReactElement
  = Host { host: ReactHostElement }
  | Composite { composite: ReactCompositeElement }
  // Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/Fragment — keyed fragments carry
  //         `key` on the element object (same createElement extraction as host/composite).
  | Fragment { key: ReactOptRef, child_refs: List<ReactCrossDeclRef> }


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactNode
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/createElement (Parameters: `...children`) +
//         https://react.dev/learn (React node mental model)
//
// Partial `children` slice: nested elements vs declaration-backed text — not the full
// react.dev child lattice (arrays, portals, conditional null, numbers, …). Full
// lattice: Owned ELSEWHERE (header; JSX/TSX → `Node`). Cannot claim 🟢 terminal
// until absorbed or proven equivalent (modeling-discipline.md).
//
// Coproduct dissolution (Practice 4) — 🟡 YELLOW (T-4.7; not terminal).
// Dissolution: operator-ratified PR (a) extends coproduct + re-audits ledger, or
// (b) retires sum for JSX/TSX extdeps owning full node algebra (T-16). Pin bump
// alone does not dissolve — child churn is grammar/lowering unless react.dev
// narrows contract materially.
// Ledger — five patterns:
//   1. Fact placement — FAILS: portal/array/null children folded into `Text`.
//   2. Variant-is-data — FAILS: Bool `is_text` admits impossible union with portals.
//   3. Algebraic form — PARTIAL: full node algebra lives in `Node` / JSX until dissolution.
//   4. Dimensional — FAILS: exactly one **modeled** child kind per inhabitant **within this slice**.
//   5. Parameterized family — FAILS: not `ReactNode<Width>` Practice‑7 ladder yet.
// Partial slice under the pin: **Element | Text** only until a dissolution PR above.
type ReactNode
  = Element { element: ReactElement }
  | Text { text_value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef }


// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ReactContextBinding
// Anchor: https://react.dev/reference/react/createContext — `createContext(defaultValue)`
//         (required operand; may be `null` per docs) +
//         https://react.dev/learn/passing-data-deeply-with-context
type ReactContextBinding {
  context_pair_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
  default_value_ref: ReactCrossDeclRef
}
